{"unit_id":"GodLike2020__dsh-mqtt-tools#feature-1","repo":"GodLike2020/dsh-mqtt-tools","commit":"8ab3cca36e0698752d8a4a3612ce2d6eca427819","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mqtt-tools 的功能「MQTT 客户端连接」：在侧边栏保存多个 Broker 配置，连接后订阅或退订主题，并按主题发布文本或二进制消息。客户端状态与收到的消息进入共享日志，供面板查看和智能体读取。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:2362-2462","lib/clients.js:310-316","lib/tools.js:544-545"]}
